	(text_box "Camera connector\nWe aim for DVP 8-10 data cameras with SCCM:\nOV2640\nOV5647\n\nThe pinout we match Waveshare's breakout boards:\nhttps://files.waveshare.com/upload/9/99/OV2640-Camera-Board-Schematic.pdf\n\nWe only provide 3.3V power, for breakout boards with built-in regulators"
